  <div class="q-head">Questions 1–13</div>

  <div class="q-sub">Questions 1–7</div>
  <div class="q-instr"><p>Reading Passage 1 has seven paragraphs, <b>A–G</b>.</p><p>Choose the correct heading for each paragraph from the list of headings below.</p><p>Write the correct number, <b>i–x</b>, in boxes 1–7 on your answer sheet.</p></div>
